    $pepper-vinyl/function="find_suggestion_author"

    u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/suggestion)
        $pepper-vinyl/tablet_dyn=show_suggestion_author
        Here is the newest vinyl from $pepper-vinyl/selected_author:  "$pepper-vinyl/suggestion" .
        Do you want to listen to a demo of it?

        u2: ([
                ~acceptance
                "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==yes"
            ])
            $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name=$pepper-vinyl/suggestion
            ^gotoReactivate(play_vinyl)

        u2: ([
                ~refusal
                "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==no"
            ])
            $pepper-vinyl/tablet=ask_do-you-want-to-buy
            Do you want to buy it?

            u3: ([
                    ~acceptance
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==yes"
                ])
                $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name=$pepper-vinyl/suggestion
                ^gotoReactivate(get_the_vinyl)

            u3: ([
                    ~refusal
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==no"
                ])
                ^gotoReactivate(need_something_else)



proposal: %demo
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet=execute_show-vinyls-empty
    $pepper-vinyl/function=idle_animation_2
    Here is the catalogue of the vinyls available, you can also directly tell me the name of what you are looking for.
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet_dyn=show_vinyls

    u1: (_*)
        $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name=$1
        ^gotoReactivate(play_vinyl)

    u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/tablet_finish)
        $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name = $pepper-vinyl/answer
        ^gotoReactivate(play_vinyl)



proposal: %play_vinyl
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet_dyn=playing_music
    Ok! I'll start playing a demo from $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_name
    $pepper-vinyl/function=play_demo

        u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/finish_wait $pepper-vinyl/reaction==happy)
            $pepper-vinyl/tablet=ask_do-you-want-to-buy
            I see that you really liked the demo. Are you interested in buying the vinyl?

            u2: ([
                    ~acceptance
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==yes"
                ])
                ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)

            u2: ([
                    ~refusal
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==no"
                ])
                ^gotoReactivate(need_something_else)                

        u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/finish_wait $pepper-vinyl/reaction==neutral)
            $pepper-vinyl/tablet=ask_do-you-want-to-buy
            I see you have mixed emotions about this demo. Despite that, are you interested in buying the vinyl?

            u2: ([
                    ~acceptance
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==yes"
                ])
                ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)

            u2: ([
                    ~refusal
                    "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==no"
                ])
                ^gotoReactivate(need_something_else)


        u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/finish_wait $pepper-vinyl/reaction==disgusted)
            Oh, I see that you didn't like it very much... I won't play it again, let's try with something else.
            ^gotoReactivate(need_something_else)



proposal: %recommendation
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet=execute_computing-recommendations
    I will compute some recommendations based on your interactions, it might take a while so wait here!
    $pepper-vinyl/function=thinking_animation
    $pepper-vinyl/function=recommendations

    u1: (e:pepper-vinyl/recommendations) %retry_recommendation
        $pepper-vinyl/tablet_dyn=show_recommendations
        Based on you interactions i think you could like the following vinyls: $pepper-vinyl/recommendations
        Are you interested in any of these?

        u2: (~acceptance)
            Which one is of your interest?

            # --- answer from voice ---
            u3: (_*)
                $pepper-vinyl/request=$1
                $pepper-vinyl/function=check_recommendation_request

                u4: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==true)
                    ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)
                
                u4: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==false)
                    I don't think that was the name of a vinyl.
                    ^gotoReactivate(retry_recommendation)

            # --- answer from tablet ---
            u3: (e:pepper-vinyl/answer)
                $pepper-vinyl/request=$pepper-vinyl/answer
                $pepper-vinyl/function=check_recommendation_request

                u4: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==true)
                    ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)
                
                u4: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==false)
                    I don't think that was the name of a vinyl.
                    ^gotoReactivate(retry_recommendation)

        u2: ([
                ~refusal
                "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==back"
            ])
            ^gotoReactivate(need_something_else)

        # --- answer from voice ---
        u2: (_*)
            $pepper-vinyl/request=$1
            $pepper-vinyl/function=check_recommendation_request

            u3: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==true)
                ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)
            
            u3: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==false)
                I don't think that was the name of a vinyl.
                ^gotoReactivate(retry_recommendation)

        # --- answer from tablet ---
        u2: (e:pepper-vinyl/answer)
            $pepper-vinyl/request=$pepper-vinyl/answer
            $pepper-vinyl/function=check_recommendation_request

            u3: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==true)
                ^gotoReactivate(check_storage)
            
            u3: (e:pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized $pepper-vinyl/vinyl_recognized==false)
                I don't think that was the name of a vinyl.
                ^gotoReactivate(retry_recommendation)



proposal: %need_something_else
    $pepper-vinyl/tablet=ask_need-something-else
    Do you need help with something else?

    u1: ([
            ~acceptance
            "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==yes"
        ])
        ^gotoReactivate(menu)

    u1: ([
            ~refusal
            "e:pepper-vinyl/answer $pepper-vinyl/answer==no"
        ])
        $pepper-vinyl/tablet=execute_goodbye
        $pepper-vinyl/function=bow
        Thank you for choosing our store, you can find the cashier near the entrance.
        If you need something else you can ask me again.
        $pepper-vinyl/function=reset

        u2: (e:pepper-vinyl/finish_wait)
            ^gotoReactivate(restart)